.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH beefetch 1 - - ""
.SH NAME
\fRbeefetch \- \fP\fRNeofetch clone written in Rust with 🐝\fP
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbeefetch\fP\fR \fP\fR[\fP\fB\-n\fP\fR] [\fP\fB\-f\fP\fR=\fP\fILIST\fP\fR] [\fP\fB\-c\fP\fR=\fP\fIPATH\fP\fR]\fP
.PP
.SS AVAILABLE\ OPTIONS:
.TP
\fB\-n\fP\fR, \fP\fB\-\-no\-color\fP
\fRDisable ANSI colors (also NO_COLOR=1)\fP
.PP
.TP
\fB\-f\fP\fR, \fP\fB\-\-fields\fP\fR=\fP\fILIST\fP
\fRFields to show, in order: os, kernel, uptime, ram, wm, server\fP
.PP
.TP
\fB\-c\fP\fR, \fP\fB\-\-config\fP\fR=\fP\fIPATH\fP
\fRConfig file [default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/beefetch/config]\fP
.PP
.TP
\fRUses environment variable \fP\fBBEEFETCH_CONFIG\fP
.PP
.TP
\fB\-h\fP\fR, \fP\fB\-\-help\fP
\fRPrints help information\fP
.PP
.TP
\fB\-V\fP\fR, \fP\fB\-\-version\fP
\fRPrints version information\fP
.PP
